        "cooked": "<p>Something weird happened with absolute zeo yesterday and we were a little lost.  :o<br>\nAZ had quite a few items : 9 in total.<br>\nAnd to be frank between the card he played and his power we did not know what could happen anymore…<br>\nFor example (simple) if he redirects damage done to himself will it be before or after damage is reduced?<br>\nI will try to find all the cards but at the end of the game we did not know anymore what would happen if AZ tried to user his power… (He could redirect, heal himself, suffer damage…)  :-[</p>",
