        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/4af34b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-12-23T12:59:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Okay I will check that! <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> I remember AZ also had a card stating that he received as much damage as cold damage he had done during the turn or something like that… And another telling he dealt as much damage as fire damage he had received before his turn…<br>\nI have to reread the cards (I wasn’t the player) but it seemed a lot to manage! <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 8,
